  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "車用電子與感測系統概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION OF AUTOMOTIVE ELECTRONICS AND SENSING SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "介紹車用電子與感測系統的功能用途、整合測試及技術原理，車用電子系統、車用電子感測系統、智慧感知及路徑規劃、先進駕駛輔助系統(ADAS)等等。能概述應用於無人自駕車實現關鍵技術應用，實施案例說明與問題討論。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the automotive electronics and sensing systems of control interpret sensory information to identify appropriate navigation paths and Advanced Driver Assistance System (ADAS). It includes the advanced of unmanned self-driving car. Some special topics and examples of advanced automotive sensor will be discussed and explained.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
